his email already exists\\\". Registration form remained available showing all entered data for user to correct or try different email.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"bookshelf\\\" in search box - results filtered to 1 item in real-time without requiring search submission. Clearing filters restored full list of 10 items without page reload. Search responds to user input immediately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied Books category filter (1 result). Then applied \\\"New\\\" condition filter - results immediately updated to \\\"0 items available\\\" with \\\"No items found\\\" message displayed. Both filters remained active in sidebar (Books and New checked). No page reload required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added \\\"Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf\\\" to cart. Immediate \\\"Added to cart!\\\" notification displayed, cart count button updated from empty to \\\"1\\\", and cart line item retained all required data (title, photo, location, price: $320). No manual reload required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Listing detail page displays: photo (image), title \\\"Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf\\\", description \\\"Custom-built bookshelf...\\\", price $320, category \\\"Furniture\\\", condition \\\"New\\\", location \\\"Portland, OR (9 mi)\\\", seller \\\"James Wilson (Portland, OR)\\\", listing date \\\"Listed 2024-11-23\\\", upcycled status badge \\\"Upcycled\\\", and availability implied by functional \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buttons.\"}]}"
